# CHIME CIRCUIT: the CPU pilots. They fly the same ships, but slower than a
# good player: each has its own top speed for the race, under the ships'
# 560. In the opening scrum they slash at whoever is in reach. On TWIN FLUE
# they would rather wreck ships than race: more of them hunt.
seed 11
game chime
wait 30
cheat race 3
expect skill0 == 0
expect skill1 >= 370
expect skill1 <= 440
expect skill2 <= 440
expect skill3 <= 440
expect skill4 <= 440
expect skill5 <= 440
botuntil cpu_knocks >= 1 600
botuntil fin0 == 1 30000
expect cpu_laps >= 20
cheat race 6
expect hunters >= 2
botuntil fin0 == 1 30000
expect place0 >= 1
